      {
        "id": "p02",
        "title": "On paper",
        "kind": "report",
        "body": "# Two years at Northwind\n\nA story is a scroll and a page is a rectangle, so there is nothing to\nfreeze one into. What the Story node does instead is more useful:\nunderneath the scrolling it **is** an illustrated article \u2014 a picture,\nthen the steps that talk about it \u2014 and that is what prints here.\n\nGive the embed a generous `height=`, because a report shows the top of the\ncard's box and a story squeezed into 300px is a headline and one chart.\n\n![[Two years at Northwind|width=100%|height=1500|radius=12]]\n\n## The charts on their own\n\nThe same three visuals the story is built from, each still a node you can\nput anywhere else.\n\n![[How much changed|width=100%|radius=12]]\n\n![[Who is ahead|width=100%|radius=12]]\n\n![[What it is made of|width=100%|radius=12]]\n"
      }
